(7708059, 1266291, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this at night on a visit with Corey in 2010. Couldn''t see much at night. Curious to find out of this is a drone shot or from an aircraft.</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this at night on a visit with Corey in 2010. Couldn''t see much at night. Curious to find out of this is a drone shot or from an aircraft.', '2021-12-04 19:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
