(7708061, 1266235, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can see this decorating a local hotel room when I am staying nearby. (I always check out the decor in the hotels. Often it is photos of whatever the local area is famous for.)</td>', 'I can see this decorating a local hotel room when I am staying nearby. (I always check out the decor in the hotels. Often it is photos of whatever the local area is famous for.)', '2021-12-04 19:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
