(7708344, 1266045, 86447, '<td valign="top">[quote]P.S. I was so darn close to finally reaching my new PB after more than 10 years ;). The score was actually 8.0 until just a couple of hours before rollover! But the last couple of votes brought it down quite a bit... oh well.[/quote]

